Modified: the Method section of skills/wirk/SKILL.md condenses ideas from Superpowers'
writing-plans, subagent-driven-development, dispatching-parallel-agents,
test-driven-development, verification-before-completion and
finishing-a-development-branch skills into WIRK's own card, ticket template, size rule,
model-tier rule, evidence rule and hand-back status words, rewritten for work items,
reservations and boards in WIRK. Parallel waves of workers that own disjoint files are
WIRK's departure from Superpowers' one-at-a-time dispatch. Not included: its session-start
injection and forcing frame, brainstorming, writing-skills, worktree mechanics, reviewer
prompt templates and ledger scripts.

